# built by build_exe.bat / PyInstaller
build/
dist/
*.spec
# kits and caches
*.zip
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Screenshots / pictures in the top folder are never part of the app. Images the app needs live in soe2/templates/
# (and the .ico); anything else stays out of the repository and out of pull requests.
/*.png
/*.jpg
/*.jpeg
/*.gif
/*.webp
/*.bmp

# Scan stash: your own stash shots and counts are wealth data - never commit them
stashref/
*stash*shot*.png
counts.json
